{"confidence": "secondary-source", "content": "## Atomic summary\n\nA video description presents a desktop assistant that combines voice, camera-based interaction and smart-home controls. Before adapting such a demo to Nivus, validate offline behavior, device/API permissions, retention of camera and audio, physical privacy controls, and safe confirmation for actuators.\n\n## When it applies\n\nUse this note when evaluating voice/avatar interfaces or camera-assisted home automation. A visual demo does not establish reliable person identification, safety, or production readiness.\n\n## Evidence and limits\n\nThe summary is based on indexed description metadata, not an independent inspection of source files or a safety test. Nivus does not currently implement this multimodal assistant.\n\n## References\n\n- [Video research index](../../docs/VIDEO_RESEARCH_INDEX.md)\n- [Nivus vision and safety boundaries](../../docs/VISION.md)", "id": "multimodal-assistant-demo", "record_type": "topic-note", "source": "docs/VIDEO_RESEARCH_INDEX.md; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WgqDaqqto90", "source_file": "knowledge/topics/multimodal-assistant-demo.md", "tags": ["voice", "vision", "camera", "microphone", "privacy-switch", "smart-home", "human-review"], "title": "Multimodal assistant demos need privacy and safety review", "tokens": ["a", "actuators", "adapting", "an", "and", "api", "applies", "assistant", "assisted", "atomic", "audio", "automation", "avatar", "based", "before", "behavior", "boundaries", "camera", "combines", "confirmation", "controls", "currently", "demo", "demos", "description", "desktop", "device", "docs", "does", "establish", "evaluating", "evidence", "files", "for", "home", "human", "identification", "implement", "independent", "index", "indexed", "inspection", "interaction", "interface", "interfaces", "is", "it", "limits", "md", "metadata", "microphone", "multimodal", "need", "nivus", "not", "note", "of", "offline", "on", "or", "permissions", "person", "physical"